2f:Tec1,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I book a private taxi in Dammam?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Send the pickup, drop-off, date, passengers and luggage by the form or on WhatsApp. We reply with the vehicle and one fixed fare, usually within 1–2 hours, before anything is booked — no meter and no surge."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a single ride inside Dammam or to Al Khobar?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. A one-way or return trip between any two addresses in Dammam, Al Khobar or Dhahran — hotel, office, mall, the Corniche or Ithra — is booked the same way, with one fare for the whole car."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a Dammam taxi number I can message?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Use the WhatsApp button or the form on this page; both reach our booking team 24 hours a day. This is a pre-booked private car service, not a street taxi rank, so send the time and addresses ahead."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you do King Fahd Airport (DMM) pickups?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, 24/7. We track your flight, meet you at arrivals and the first 15–30 minutes of waiting are free. Dhahran is about 50 km from DMM and Jubail about 90 km."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I hire a driver by the hour in Dammam or Al Khobar?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Book a car and driver for a block of hours or a full day — the driver waits between stops. Send the date, start time, hours and rough stops, and the fare is agreed before booking."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you take us from Dammam or Al Khobar to Bahrain?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Dammam to Manama is about 70 km and Al Khobar to Manama about 50 km over the King Fahd Causeway. The vehicle's crossing fee is included; passengers bring their own passports and entry documents."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I go from Dammam to Doha by car?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. It is about 400 km through the Salwa border. The vehicle's border fees are included in the fare; visas and entry are each passenger's own."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you pick up visitors for Aramco, KFUPM or Jubail sites?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — send the host company, gate or building and the meeting time. Site access is arranged by your host; the driver uses those details to plan the pickup point. We are not affiliated with any of these organisations."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can my company get a written quote and invoice?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Email the trips, dates and passengers for a written quote. Corporate invoicing can be arranged through our sister company."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which cars are available in the Eastern Province?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sedans, full-size SUVs such as the GMC Yukon XL, vans, coasters and luxury cars including the Mercedes S-Class are available through our partner network. The exact vehicle is confirmed for your date and group size when we quote."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I cancel or change a booking?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Cancellation is free up to 24 hours before pickup, and changes to the time or address can be made on WhatsApp."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do the drivers speak English?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Drivers in our partner network speak English and Arabic, and trips run 24 hours a day."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I pay?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Cash to the driver or bank transfer. An electronic receipt is available on request."}}]}28:["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2f"}}]
