r sister company"}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]
2b:["$","div",null,{"className":"section-container max-w-6xl space-y-20 py-20 md:space-y-28 md:py-28","children":[["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"trip-heading","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8 md:mb-10 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[0.7rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#16A34A]","children":"Start here"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"trip-heading","className":"font-heading text-[1.75rem] font-bold leading-tight md:text-[2.25rem] text-[#1C1C1C]","children":"What kind of Eastern Province trip do you need?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]","children":"Pick the closest match. Each one tells you what to send for a quote and links to the page that covers it."}]]}],["$","$L36",null,{"trips":[{"id":"airport","icon":"plane","label":"DMM Airport ↔ your hotel","short":"Dammam, Khobar, Dhahran, Jubail","answer":"King Fahd International Airport (DMM) sits north-west of the cities, so every arrival is a proper drive: Dhahran is about 50 km (~40 min), Jubail about 90 km, and Dammam and Al Khobar further than Dhahran. We track your flight, meet you at arrivals, and the fare is agreed before you land.","send":["Flight number","Hotel or address (city and district)","Passengers and large bags","Return flight, if booking both ways"],"href":"/airports/king-fahd-dammam","linkLabel":"King Fahd Airport (DMM) transfers","waPrefill":"Salam! DMM Airport transfer.\n• From: \n• To (Dammam / Khobar / Dhahran / Jubail): \n• Date & time: \n• Flight number: \n• Passengers & luggage: \n(ref: dammam-hub)"},{"id":"metro","icon":"hotel","label":"Across Dammam, Khobar & Dhahran","short":"Hotel, office, mall, Corniche","answer":"One pre-booked car for a single trip inside the metro — hotel to office, Dammam to a meeting in Al Khobar, an evening on the Corniche or a visit to Ithra in Dhahran. Give us both addresses and the time, and you get one fixed fare for the whole car.","send":["Pickup address","Drop-off address","Date and time","Passengers"],"href":"#metro","linkLabel":"Dammam, Khobar and Dhahran areas","waPrefill":"Salam! Ride in the Dammam–Khobar–Dhahran area.\n• From: \n• To: \n• Date & time: \n• Passengers: \n• One-way or return: \n(ref: dammam-hub)"},{"id":"private-driver","icon":"clock","label":"Private driver by the hour","short":"Site visits, meetings, family days","answer":"A car and driver for a block of hours or a whole day — the driver waits while you are inside a meeting, a site visit or a mall. Useful when the day moves between Dammam, Al Khobar and Dhahran, or when you cannot predict when a meeting ends.","send":["Date and start time","Hours needed","Rough list of stops","Passengers"],"href":"/locations/dammam/private-driver","linkLabel":"Private driver in Dammam & Al Khobar","waPrefill":"Salam! Private driver in the Eastern Province (hourly / full day).\n• Date & start time: \n• Hours needed: \n• Stops planned: \n• Passengers: \n(ref: dammam-private-driver)"},{"id":"bahrain","icon":"route","label":"Bahrain via the Causeway","short":"70 km to Manama","answer":"Dammam to Manama is about 70 km over the King Fahd Causeway (~1 hr); from Al Khobar about 50 km. The causeway crossing fee for the vehicle is included in the fare. Each passenger carries their own passport and entry documents.","send":["Pickup address","Bahrain destination","Date and time","Passengers and nationalities"],"href":"/cross-border/saudi-to-bahrain","linkLabel":"Saudi Arabia to Bahrain by car","waPrefill":"Salam! Eastern Province → Bahrain transfer.\n• From: \n• To (Bahrain address): \n• Date & time: \n• Passengers & luggage: \n(ref: dammam-hub)"},{"id":"qatar","icon":"route","label":"Doha, Qatar by road","short":"400 km via Salwa","answer":"Dammam to Doha is about 400 km by road through the Salwa border (~4 hr). The vehicle's border fees are included in the quoted fare; visas and entry are each passenger's own.","send":["Pickup address","Doha address","Date and time","Passengers and luggage"],"href":"/routes/dammam-to-doha","linkLabel":"Dammam to Doha private car","waPrefill":"Salam! Dammam → Doha transfer.\n• From: \n• To (Doha address): \n• Date & time: \n• Passengers & luggage: \n(ref: dammam-hub)"},{"id":"riyadh","icon":"route","label":"Riyadh & other cities","short":"410 km to Riyadh","answer":"Dammam to Riyadh is about 410 km (~4 hr) — door to door, one fare for the whole car. Jeddah, Makkah, Kuwait and the UAE are booked the same way.","send":["Pickup address","Destination","Date and time","Passengers and bags"],"href":"/routes/dammam-to-riyadh","linkLabel":"Dammam to Riyadh private transfer","waPrefill":"Salam! Intercity trip from Dammam.\n• To (Riyadh / Jeddah / other): \n• Date & time: \n• Passengers & luggage: \n(ref: dammam-hub)"},{"id":"jubail","icon":"briefcase","label":"Jubail & industrial sites","short":"90 km from DMM","answer":"Jubail Industrial City is about 90 km from DMM (~1 hr 5 min). Visitors to plants or offices there share the company and site name when booking, so the pickup and drop-off point is agreed in advance.","send":["Company and site name","Pickup point","Date and time","Passengers"],"href":"/locations/jubail","linkLabel":"Jubail private transfers","waPrefill":"Salam! Jubail transfer.\n• From: \n• To (company / site): \n• Date & time: \n• Passengers: \n(ref: dammam-hub)"},{"id":"corporate","icon":"briefcase","label":"Corporate & visiting teams","short":"Written quote by email","answer":"Visiting teams, contractors and event groups get one written quote by email for all the trips and dates, with vehicles from executive sedans to coasters through our partner network. Corporate invoicing can be arranged through our sister company.","send":["Company name","Dates and trip list","Passengers per trip","Whether you need an invoice"],"href":"/services/corporate","linkLabel":"Corporate transportation","waPrefill":"Salam! Corporate transport in the Eastern Province.\n• Company: \n• Dates & trips: \n• Passenger